      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, the atmosphere is definitely there. i want to zoom in more on the people though. like, if my protagonist is walking through one of these blocks, what kind of people are they gonna see hanging out on the corners or loitering by the stores? i need to be able to paint a clear picture of the local crowd so the reader knows exactly what kind of area they've stumbled into. what does the \"local element\" look like in a place this decayed? give give give me me on the specific types of guys",
